**Defining UI Enhancements**

I've decided on the UI layout for the `RoleGenerator.tsx` component. I'll include a header and tabs: "Generate New" and "Adapt Existing." The "Generate New" tab will maintain the current functionality: header, target job role input, experience level, and generate button. For the "Adapt Existing" tab, the new UI will be a text area for resume content, an input field for the target job role, and a "Transform & Generate" button. The existing backend services will be called for parsing and transforming resumes.


