The CSP directive mentioned earlier indicates a Chrome Extension context, yet the user is just trying to fix the blank page on their deployed app. This doesn't seem to be a normal website CSP, so I'll check `index.html` to verify the imports. The use of `esm.sh` may be the root of the issue, particularly with its potential to redirect and load dependencies.


